###Mapping
Mapping demo::ivorysummit::mapping::TrailMapping
(
  *demo::ivorysummit::domain::TrailReading[trailReading]: Relational
  {
    ~primaryKey
    (
      [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count.reading_id
    )
    ~mainTable [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count
    readingId: [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count.reading_id,
    trailCode: [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count.trail_code,
    surfaceCode: [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count.surface_code,
    readingDate: [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count.reading_date,
    walkerTally: [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count.walker_tally,
    cyclistTally: [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count.cyclist_tally,
    weatherCode: [demo::ivorysummit::store::TrailCountDB]park.trail_count.weather_code
  }
)
